      "html": "<div class=\"box\">\r\n        <div class=\"content\">\r\n             <h1>Glowing Bar</h1>\r\n             <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Vitae quas recusandae expedita id atque, ipsa possimus illum veniam officia qui facere numquam, minus dignissimos iure libero totam magnam quis, corporis, voluptates. Similique doloremque, tenetur rem cum qui dolor voluptate atque molestias porro. Provident, magnam, optio. Architecto ab praesentium rem voluptatem reiciendis cumque iste vitae fugiat odit impedit! Repudiandae aliquid, debitis quisquam, alias explicabo adipisci incidunt minus reiciendis harum blanditiis vero.</p>\r\n         </div>\r\n     </div>",
      "css": "/* style.css */\nbody\r\n{\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    min-height: 100vh;\r\n    background: #060c21;\r\n    font-family: arial;\r\n}\r\n.box\r\n{\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    width: 300px;\r\n    height: 400px;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    background: #060c21;\r\n}\r\n.box:before\r\n{\r\n    content: '';\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: -2px;\r\n    left: -2px;\r\n    right: -2px;\r\n    bottom: -2px;\r\n    background: #fff;\r\n    z-index: -1;\r\n}\r\n.box:after\r\n{\r\n    content: '';\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: -2px;\r\n    left: -2px;\r\n    right: -2px;\r\n    bottom: -2px;\r\n    background: #fff;\r\n    z-index: -2;\r\n    filter: blur(40px);\r\n}\r\n.box:before,\r\n.box:after\r\n{\r\n    background: linear-gradient(235deg,#89ff00,#060c21,#00bcd4);\r\n}\r\n.content\r\n{\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    box-sizing: border-box;\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n}"
