    "code": {
      "html": "<div class=\"box\">\r\n         <div class=\"content\">\r\n            <div>\r\n                 <h2>Image Hover Effect</h2>\r\n             <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Harum quod, consectetur delectus at explicabo non, natus maxime, enim dignissimos odio porro distinctio perspiciatis beatae quos minima. Nam omnis quo optio.</p>\r\n             <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n         </div>\r\n         <img src=\"img.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n     </div>",
      "css": "/* style.css */\nbody\r\n{\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    justify-content: center;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    min-height: 100vh;\r\n}\r\n.box\r\n{\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    width: 400px;\r\n    height: 500px;\r\n    background: #000;\r\n}\r\n.content\r\n{\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n    right: 0;\r\n    bottom: 0;\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n    padding: 20px;\r\n    font-family: consolas;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n.content a\r\n{\r\n    display: inline-block;\r\n    margin-top: 20px;\r\n    padding: 10px 20px;\r\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\r\n    text-decoration: none;\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n    transition: 0.5s;\r\n}\r\n.content a:hover\r\n{\r\n    color: #000;\r\n    background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.box img\r\n{\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: 0;\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    height: 100%;\r\n    object-fit: cover;\r\n    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\r\n    transition: 2s;\r\n}\r\n.box:hover img\r\n{\r\n    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 0 0, 0 100%);\r\n}"
    }
